<tr valign="top" height="300" >
<td tEditID="c1r2" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r2" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_Hlk144985533"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Dear</span></a><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">&nbsp;<span style="background: yellow;">[BPL Name]</span>,<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoHeader"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoHeader"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">I wanted to make you aware of some changes we are making in the new year to better align Red Cross operations. The changes will define a common set of geographic boundaries for both Biomedical and Humanitarian Services, further strengthening our organization and improving mission delivery.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoHeader"><b><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></b></p><p class="MsoHeader"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">There will be&nbsp;<b>no</b>&nbsp;changes in our partnership, but we wanted to ensure you were updated. We are excited about how this geographical realignment will enhance connections within our organization, our trusted partners and our donors.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoHeader"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoHeader"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">If you have any questions, please don’t hesitate to reach out.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoHeader"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoHeader"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">We are so grateful for your support of our lifesaving mission!<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_Hlk74312011"></a><a name="_Hlk144985593"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></a></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: yellow;">&lt;Current AM/ABM Signature</span><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: yellow;">&gt;</span></p>]]></td>
</tr>
